  "core_idea": "**More** as an adverb means to a greater degree, and also one more time, or, with **not any**, no longer.",
  "senses": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "signpost": "adjectives and adverbs",
      "definition": "used before an adjective or an adverb to say that something has a quality to a greater degree",
      "explanation": "Use **more** with most adjectives of two or more syllables (*more careful*, *more interesting*) and with most adverbs that end in **-ly** (*more slowly*). Most one-syllable adjectives add **-er** instead: **bigger**, **faster**.",
