  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": null,
    "grammar": "\"more\" makes comparatives mainly with longer adjectives and adverbs (*more careful*); most short ones take \"-er\" (*bigger*). Learners whose language always uses a separate word for comparison often say \"more big\".",
